Acha google stich se aur Kya Kya Kam ly skta hon sb Kuch btao


Google Stitch ek AI-powered UI/UX design aur frontend application creation platform hai. Aap is platform se apni shop, business ya kisi bhi online project ke liye be-shumar kaam le saktay hain:

1. Mukammal Mobile Apps & Web Apps Banwana
Kiryana, Superstore & Retail Apps: Jaisa ke humne abhi banaya—shopping cart, categories, product catalog, search bar aur direct WhatsApp ordering system.
Food & Restaurant Apps: Menu list, deals, table booking, food ordering aur receipt summary.
Pharmacy & Medical Store: Dawaaiyon ki list, prescription photo upload, delivery system.
Services / Booking Apps: Salon appointment, electrician/plumber booking, car wash, rent-a-car.
School / Academy Portals: Student attendance, fee khata, homework tracking screens.
2. Business Websites & Landing Pages
Company Portfolio & Landing Pages: Agar aapko dukaan ya company ke liye clean one-page modern website chahiye.
Product Showcase: Kisi khas product ya brand ki marketing ke liye promotion page.
Contact & Location Pages: Google map view, timings, customer feedback form.
3. Business Dashboards & Admin Portals
Khata & POS Dashboard: Daily sales report, cash ledger, udhaar tracking, daily total sale counter.
Inventory / Stock Management: Kitna saaman bacha hai, kon sa item khatam honay wala hai uska alert system.
Order History & Analytics: Pichlay mahinay ke orders ka record aur profit hisaab.
4. Branding, Logos & Icons
Shop Logos & Wordmarks: Dukaan ya brand ke liye professional monogram ya graphic logo design karwana.
Custom App Icons & Graphics: Custom buttons, banners, category icons (vector SVG) tayyar karwana.
5. Existing Designs & Sketches se Real App Banwana
Kaghaz par bani drawing ya sketch: Agar aap kaghaz par pencil se screen ka naqsha bana kar photo upload karein, toh yeh usko direct chalti hui digital screen me badal deta hai.
Kisi website ya app ka screenshot: Agar aapko kisi dusri app ka design pasand aaye, aap uska screenshot dikha kar waisa interface tayyar karwa saktay hain.
Website Redesign: Purani website ka link de kar usay modern aur responsive design me convert karwana.
6. Ready-to-Use Frontend Code (HTML / CSS / JavaScript)
Har bani hui screen ka mukammal clean code milta hai jisko aap:
Kisi bhi hosting (Tiiny, Netlify, Vercel) par live kar saktay hain.
Android app (.apk) me convert kar ke doston aur gahakon ke mobile me install karwa saktay hain.
Play Store ya apni domain website par publish kar saktay hain.
Aap apne business ke liye agla kya cheez test karna chahte hain—maslan dukaan ka POS/Khata Admin Dashboard, Shop ka Banner/Logo, ya koi naya business idea?


