Ehtisham General Store & Super Mart ko ek aam dukaan ki app se barh kar markeet ki top-class professional app banane ke liye yeh 6 nihayat ahem aur munafa-bakhsh ideas hain jo aam tor par zehan me nahi aate:

1. "Parchi / List Photo Upload" Order System (Bohat Ahem)
Wajah: Pakistan me aksar log lambi typing ya 10 alag alag items cart me dhoondne ke bajaye kaghaz par pencil se list likhte hain ya ghar se parchi milti hai.
Feature: App me ek button ho: "Parchi / Saaman ki List ki Photo Bhejein"—customer mobile camera se parchi ki tasweer khench kar seedha dukaan ke WhatsApp par bhej de. Dukaan daar parchi dekh kar foran delivery pack kar de.
2. "Voice Search / Bol Kar Search Karein" (Urdu Audio Mic)
Wajah: Bohot se customers typing me dushwari mehsoos karte hain (khaas tor par Urdu ya Roman Urdu me spelling ke maslay).
Feature: Search bar ke sath ek Mic 🎙️ ka nishan ho. Customer bolay "Dalda oil aur 5 kilo aata" aur search bar khud ba khud wo items nikaal de.
3. "Mahana Rashan Package" / Monthly Ration Bundles
Wajah: Har maheenay ki 1 se 10 tareekh ko gharelu rashan ki fixed khareedari hoti hai.
Feature: Ready-made packages:
