Bumper Student / Hostel Pack: Chai, biscuits, noodles, eggs, milk.
Customer sirf 1 click me poora maheenay ka rashan cart me daal sakay.
4. Digital Receipt / Print Parchi (Bill Slip)
Wajah: Customer jab order receive karta hai toh wo chahta hai ke uske paas dukaan ki stamp/naam ke sath pakka computerized bill ho.
Feature: WhatsApp par order jaane ke sath sath app customer ko ek neat "Receipt Download / Print" ka option de de, jis par shop ka naam, phone, tareekh, aur items ka total bill thermal printer style me likha ho.
5. Delivery Slots & Minimum Order Condition
