Aapne Vercel login kar liya, yeh bohot behtareen faisla hai! Vercel hamesha ke liye 100% free hai aur isme kabhi time ya plan khatam hone ka masla nahi aata.

Lekin mobile par Vercel direct code paste karne ki bajaye file upload mangta hai. Is maslay ka sab se aasan tareeqa yeh hai:

Tareeqa 1: Mobile par Code ki File (index.html) banana aur Vercel par dalna (2 Minutes)
Mobile me "Notes" ya koi text editor kholein:
Jo mukammal code maine diya tha, usay copy karein.
Apne mobile ke Notes ya kisi text app me paste karein aur file ko index.html ke naam se save karein (ya WhatsApp par kisi file ke tor par save kar lein).
Vercel Dashboard par jayein (vercel.com):
"Add New..." ya "New Project" par click karein.
Wahan "Import / Drag & Drop" ka option hota hai, wahan apni index.html file select karein.
Deploy dabayein — aapko foran apna lifetime free link (e.g. ehtisham-store.vercel.app) mil jayega!
Tareeqa 2: Vercel se bhi 10 Guna Aasan (Direct Paste & Instant Link)
Agar Vercel par file upload karna mobile par thora mushkil lag raha ho, toh mobile par direct code paste karne ke liye yeh 2 sab se aasan free platforms hain jahan sirf code paste karna hota hai:

Option A: Netlify Drop (app.netlify.com/drop)
Bilkul Vercel ki tarah 100% free aur lifetime chalta hai.
Option B: CodePen (codepen.io/pen) — Sab se tez
codepen.io/pen kholein.
Wahan teen boxes hotay hain: HTML, CSS, JS.
Sirf HTML wale box ke andar mera diya hua mukammal code paste kar dein.
Upar Save dabayein aur upar se link copy kar ke kisi ko bhi bhej dein!
Aap batayein ke kya aapne mobile me code ko index.html file ke tor par save kar liya hai, ya Vercel screen par koi khas button/option dhoondne me madad chahiye? Main step-by-step sath guide karta hoon.


